{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c876589f50ccf8cc1968ec2d07c52d54d85edd9085d9e283a59e7fd8737b53f6","ja":"「この劇場で私が一番セクシーよ！」","zh":"“在这个剧场里，我才是最性感的！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f3476e77fa7cac758004f24ae7d776b7cc254cee2459643a9ee65ff70f533aef","ja":"……今の、誰！？\nさすがに聞き捨てにできないわね……！","zh":"……刚才那是谁！？\n这可不能当做没听见呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1542e64b2f5693424557e18f61b9b92cb72f748e491e32d3dfc8bcf12528cde8","ja":"えへへっ、なんだかモノマネしてたら、\n本当に演技が上手になってきてる気がするな♪","zh":"嘿嘿，总觉得一直模仿的话，\n自己的演技真的好像越来越好了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"628ecb4fe8c7964cbf5a566f4941c0eea6d6ad3922644ea6963ec9fe31218817","ja":"桃子の言ったとおりでしょ♪\nそれじゃあ次は……。","zh":"桃子说得没错吧♪\n那么接下来是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e","ja":"ガチャッ！","zh":"（开门声）","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3ef9656ae9a310a4b997cac6ee180cfe748c2cba748661c741a8fa52d160fbe1","ja":"ちょっと待ちなさ～い！　一番のセクシーを\n名乗るなら、この私を倒して……って、あら？","zh":"等等～！　要是想自称第一性感，\n就先打倒我……咦，哎呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c131ed1930792799cf8833e7d70c0c21fbd06d146a53ac2709855b2eacbcf4b2","ja":"このみさん！？\nどうしたの、急に？","zh":"木实小姐！？\n怎么了，这么突然？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"772f811bd49f2f181f05c1cc5cb17e43af9ce5a27110a76616f826672ea685af","ja":"ここにいるのって、桃子ちゃんと育ちゃんだけ？\n今、「私が一番セクシー」って聞こえたんだけど……？","zh":"这里只有桃子和小育吗？\n我刚才好像听到有人说“我才是最性感的”……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ed433d10eadfcb576ceaaa682068ee8a1704479bbf1c3313d4a3c19d856449ea","ja":"それ、わたしだよ。お芝居の練習で、\nこのみさんのモノマネしてたんだ。","zh":"那是我啦。因为在练习演戏，\n所以模仿了一下木实小姐。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b8b839d116e0fc4542912a745c5d30f2ca7714be3beb1c5c188879b61e81ebf0","ja":"私のモノマネだったの！？　そう言われてみれば、\nたしかに私っぽかった気がするわね……。","zh":"是在模仿我吗！？听你这么一说，\n感觉确实挺像我的呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"015f396327fe930a54502c2379ff505bcb08581f24dbf5bc582911043700feb3","ja":"練習の邪魔しちゃってごめんなさいね。\nそれじゃあ、頑張って！","zh":"打扰你练习真是不好意思呢。\n那么，加油哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"50c6c0fdcaa619acba1b4eaced0d879c5a2a9a241148887319ec39c85fcf084a","ja":"じゃあ、もう少しやってみるね！\n次は……。","zh":"那我再试试看吧！\n接下来是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"57b44e5e18189ff3f1233fd028a3455b55514d219ec5b6a8eddb311f55986a9f","ja":"「それでは、これからマジックを披露します。\n……最新作だぞ」","zh":"「那么，接下来就为大家表演魔术。\n……这可是最新作哦」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e","ja":"ガチャッ！","zh":"（开门声）","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3ceca5eff4393738d6c26d75e90d5ffb226591bfbb4a0523a7cd71fa1d790c3e","ja":"最新のマジック、興味があります。\nぜひ私にも見せてください……おや？","zh":"我对最新的魔术很感兴趣。\n请务必也让我看一看……哎呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"14eb01e1538768b9fb32ad1e97df721979bf86251d48e354e3a647179cbe770c","ja":"あの、瑞希さん。桃子たち、\n演技の練習しているだけだから……。","zh":"那个，瑞希。我和桃子她们\n只是在练习演技而已……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"87d83c502b2d8ecb5dc97720e9c15c3fd901b865933f9b3f09c2c7b2e00163ed","ja":"なんと、そうでしたか……。\nそれでは、私は邪魔にならないように退出します。","zh":"原来是这样啊……。\n那我为了不打扰你们，就先退出了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"dfab95d67f4f13734d9704a2baf9afb60a6ccc196a5b07cb8515e11faf6fca14","ja":"……そ、それじゃあ次は貴音さんをやってみるね。\n「ふふっ、とても美味しそうな、らーめんです……」","zh":"……那、那么接下来我就试试贵音小姐吧。\n“呵呵，看起来非常美味的拉面呢……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
