{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"5fa5a4b1b4744d84e935946f72bfb1fb261b0f985933612f77f7781adaf71b0e","ja":"らーめんを食べるのですか？\nあの、もしよろしければ私も……。","zh":"您要吃拉面吗？\n那个，如果可以的话我也想……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1307.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"513cf05a416263913582e5457b7d035d5d9ab66adae7e0c7fa7d9251dbfe5ae6","ja":"（モノマネで演技の練習するの、\n劇場でやらない方が良いのかも……）","zh":"（靠模仿来练习演技，\n可能还是不要在剧场里做比较好……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
